sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as odh-gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Proxy as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant REST as rest-service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant Flight as flight-service<br/>8443/TCP gRPC TLS
    participant PG as PostgreSQL<br/>5432/TCP
    participant DS as Data Source Backend

    rect rgb(240, 248, 255)
        Note over Client,PG: Flow 1: REST API Request (Connection CRUD)
        Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443<br/>Bearer Token
        Gateway->>Proxy: HTTPS/8443<br/>TLS (service-serving cert)
        Proxy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 (SA token)
        K8sAPI-->>Proxy: Auth decision (allow/deny)
        Proxy->>REST: HTTP/8080 (localhost)<br/>X-Remote-User / X-Remote-Groups
        REST->>PG: SQL/5432<br/>TLS (rustls, optional)<br/>Password auth
        PG-->>REST: Connection metadata
        REST-->>Proxy: JSON response
        Proxy-->>Gateway: HTTPS response
        Gateway-->>Client: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(255, 248, 240)
        Note over Client,DS: Flow 2: Data Retrieval (Arrow Flight)
        Client->>Gateway: HTTPS/443 or gRPC
        Gateway->>Flight: gRPC/8443<br/>TLS (service-serving cert)<br/>Bearer token
        Flight->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>HTTPS/6443 (SA token)
        K8sAPI-->>Flight: Auth decision (allow/deny)
        Flight->>PG: SQL/5432<br/>Connection metadata lookup
        PG-->>Flight: Connector config + credentials
        Flight->>DS: Data query<br/>Protocol varies per connector<br/>Per-connector credentials
        DS-->>Flight: Raw data
        Flight-->>Gateway: Arrow RecordBatch stream<br/>gRPC/8443 TLS
        Gateway-->>Client: Arrow RecordBatch stream
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over REST,Flight: Flow 3: REST-to-Flight Proxy (Credential Test)
        REST->>Flight: gRPC/8443<br/>TLS (service-CA)<br/>Forwarded Bearer token
        Flight->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview
        K8sAPI-->>Flight: Auth decision
        Flight->>DS: Test connection<br/>Per-connector protocol
        DS-->>Flight: Connection status
        Flight-->>REST: Test result
    end
